"ACME › ◆ ACME-1 Single sign-on › ACME-5                                                                                                               "
"● Login times out after SSO redirect                                                                                                                  "
"                                                                                                                                                      "
"── Description ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │Status                                             "
"After the SSO redirect, the callback sometimes takes more than 30 s and the login page shows      │ IN PROGRESS                                       "
"Session expired.                                                                                  │                                                   "
"                                                                                                  │Assignee                                           "
"Steps to reproduce                                                                                │Colin Tenaguillo ★                                 "
"                                                                                                  │                                                   "
"1. Configure an Okta tenant with MFA                                                              │Reporter                                           "
"2. Sign in from a cold browser                                                                    │Ana Silva                                          "
"3. Wait on the push notification for ~25 s                                                        │                                                   "
"                                                                                                  │Priority                                           "
"Logs                                                                                              │⇈ Highest                                          "
"                                                                                                  │                                                   "
"╭ log                                                                                             │Sprint                                             "
"│ 2026-10-12T09:14:03Z WARN auth::callback state=7f3a.. elapsed=31.2s                             │Sprint 14                                          "
"│ 2026-10-12T09:14:03Z ERROR auth::session expired before exchange                                │                                                   "
"                                                                                                  │Epic                                               "
"The state cookie has a 30 s TTL, see auth/session.rs. Ping @Ana Silva who wrote the exchange.     │◆ Single sign-on                                   "
"                                                                                                  │                                                   "
"── Attachments ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │Labels                                             "
"▪ session-expired.png  image/png  47 KB                                                           │ auth   backend                                    "
"▪ callback.log  text/plain  1 KB                                                                  │                                                   "
"                                                                                                  │Estimate                                           "
"Comments (3)   History   All                                                                      │3                                                  "
"────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │                                                   "
"Ana Silva  2026-09-02 21:00                                                                       │Due                                                "
"I can reproduce with MFA on. Without MFA it's fine.                                               │2026-09-12                                         "
"                                                                                                  │                                                   "
"Colin Tenaguillo  2026-09-02 22:00                                                                │Created                                            "
"Raising the TTL to 120 s fixes it locally. Is there a reason it was 30?                           │2026-09-02 20:00                                   "
"                                                                                                  │                                                   "
"Ana Silva  2026-09-02 23:00                                                                       │Updated                                            "
"Only caution. 120 s is fine, the state is single-use anyway.                                      │2026-09-03 11:00                                   "
